ck` stay unchanged;\n- the Developer edits only `src/**`, and QA writes the tests;\n- `pyproject.toml` is not edited;\n- both `pytest` and `ruff` must pass;\n- CI, configuration and packaging are not changed.\n\nNo human input is needed; the BA's assumptions A1–A4 settle the open points.\n\nFiles are in `.dark-factory/runs/df76c4d7-a365-4333-b306-465efb84b6a0/artifacts/ARCHITECTURE/`:\n- `design.md`\n- `constraints.json`","ttft_ms":2545,"type":"result","duration_ms":50014,"uuid":"e896bcad-f2f1-4ede-b8a0-b31fb6ae55c2","ttft_stream_ms":1167,"time_to_request_ms":262,"first_content_frame_ms":1168,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
